// 2026-11-12, pre-print) does not carry them yet; the next regeneration of the block above will, and then this is only a fallback (a value
// the archive already has is never overwritten). Non-GAAP R&D = GAAP 7,454 − 193 acquisition-related; non-GAAP SG&A = non-GAAP
// opex 8,841 − that R&D (GAAP 1,702 less 15 acquisition-related and the 107 legal settlement, which the 8-K does not assign to a
