// The nine headline lines of the guide (§12), on NVIDIA's measures: operating income = non-GAAP (the basis NVIDIA guides and the
// Street forecasts); EPS = GAAP (the basis approved in EV-RES-DATA).
var NHEAD=['Revenue','Gross profit','Operating income','EBITDA','EPS (diluted, GAAP)','Operating cash flow','Capex','D&A','Diluted shares'];
// Lines NVIDIA guides for the next quarter (8-K outlook): revenue, gross margin and operating expenses.
